Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.96,0:01:31.36,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Message from the enemy fleet:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.66,0:02:41.64,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The Isokaze has been hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:42.87,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and is leaving formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.76,0:02:59.15,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Damage to starboard deck three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.06,0:09:23.75,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Everyone, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:24.75,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Everyone, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.27,0:15:05.59,Announcement,,0,0,0,,At 16:30 today, a riot broke out in zone 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.61,0:15:08.13,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Sector 702 has been sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.51,0:20:06.53,Announcement,,0,0,0,,The enemy is targeting the sea area off Bonomisaki Cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.53,0:20:08.85,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Longitude 30 degrees, 40 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We are currently in orbit 200,000 kilometers from Pluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No enemy sighted off the coast of Pluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The seas are calm. It's almost scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.23,0:00:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Send up a signal round.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.12,0:00:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"I have entered the operations area."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.75,0:00:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Spotters report enemy sighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.58,0:00:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Multiple contacts. Starboard, four o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.42,0:00:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,EM wave restrictions released.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Identify enemy ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,One Super-Dreadnought Class Warship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.09,0:00:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,One Super-Dreadnought Class Warship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven battleships.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty two cruisers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.26,0:00:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Multiple destroyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.84,0:01:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All ships to combat positions. 30 to starboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.06,0:01:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for torpedo exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.47,0:01:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.46,0:01:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Distance 7500.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.08,0:01:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Relative speeds unchanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.67,0:01:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,"Attention Earth fleet,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,surrender immediately."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.67,0:01:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How shall we respond?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.47,0:01:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them: "Nuts."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nuts!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.51,0:01:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth fleet responding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.81,0:01:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nuts."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.49,0:02:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yugiri has sunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.95,0:02:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kurama is leaving formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.53,0:02:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.45,0:02:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.79,0:02:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy ship is in firing range.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.04,0:02:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Target locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Open all gunports!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.06,0:02:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Evasive maneuvers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.69,0:02:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The Abukuma and Shimakaze have sunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Still no word from the Amaterasu?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No messages received, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Will they really come?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.91,0:02:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:02:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaking cyanide gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Engine output is dropping!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.43,0:03:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Damage control, get those bulkheads down! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.81,0:03:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.19,0:03:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.57,0:03:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We have lost control of our vessel! We are leaving formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.57,0:03:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Our main cannon just isn't big enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.65,0:03:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy has an overwhelming advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.99,0:03:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This was an ambush?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn the ship! Reverse course!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Firefighting teams, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.79,0:03:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep working! Maintain output!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch for plasma leaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.42,0:03:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.22,0:03:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got things under control, but at this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.93,0:03:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe. That man is helming this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fleet has suffered eighty percent damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.69,0:03:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Signal from Amaterasu confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.77,0:03:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're on course, at outer space speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.98,0:04:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They will be passing Neptune shortly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.28,0:04:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes until target reaches Mars!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.37,0:04:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Send an encoded message to HQ:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.58,0:04:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Stone Door of Heaven is opening."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,At 1200, the First Fleet encountered the enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.09,0:04:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,380,000 kilometers off the coast of Pluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.55,0:04:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The state of the battle is currently unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A message from Commander Okita of the Kirishima.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Stone Door of Heaven is opening," he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's going as planned so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.35,0:04:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,When will the rendezvous with the target take place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.64,0:04:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a two-man recovery squad waiting at Arcadia Port on Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.57,0:04:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been three weeks since we were dropped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.49,0:04:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Operation M was a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's fighting on Pluto, and I'm just sitting here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our cue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.86,0:05:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.53,0:05:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.99,0:05:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an escape pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.15,0:06:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She's beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.17,0:06:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Isokaze's been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.25,0:06:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Uzume has recovered from Amaterasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The First Fleet's operation is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.32,0:06:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdraw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy destroyer approaching quickly from above us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sight target.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gunports one and two, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.93,0:07:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirmed hit. Target destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy ship has sunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy fleet is reorganizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Issue a withdrawal order to all ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How many allied ships survived?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just us and one destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.11,0:07:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.65,0:07:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Major Kodai's Yukikaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.61,0:07:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdrawal signal from the Kirishima.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdrawal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"We will now withdraw. Follow us."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.66,0:07:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard to starboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yukikaze isn't turning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.84,0:07:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.51,0:08:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Okita, I'm not going to withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.35,0:08:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yukikaze will remain on the battlefield and support the Kirishima's withdrawal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.52,0:08:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai, we've made many sacrifices, but the operation was a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdraw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something, Earth's fleet will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.66,0:08:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there will be no one left to protect the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Okita, you cannot die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The same thing is true for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The same thing, Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.05,0:08:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.59,0:08:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Those words are enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.05,0:08:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Be well. I leave the Earth in your care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go give their base a hard kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.07,0:08:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Cross the waves of the galactic sea
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.91,0:09:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim for the fixed star of Centauri
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.70,0:09:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Far beyond the twinkling of the stars
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A shining ship of the stars twinkling in space
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.50,0:09:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail! We're leaving port! Raise the anchor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.93,0:09:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold 'er steady, ahoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn the rudder toward the stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yukikaze has headed into the enemy fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.11,0:09:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.07,0:09:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamanami, maintain course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintain course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.91,0:09:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay alive, Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Uzume, requesting permission to dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.33,0:10:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the fleet? Where's my brother's ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Here lies a visitor from a distant star
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.35,0:10:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hirata, tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the Yukikaze?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.32,0:10:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my brother's ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.62,0:11:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kirishima has recovered the Amaterasu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.83,0:11:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and has set a course to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.74,0:11:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It cost many lives, but Operation M was a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the Yamato Plan can actually start, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's just beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.13,0:11:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too much we don't know about our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.88,0:11:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is that the enemy are demons called Gamilas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.62,0:11:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now entering Earth orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.29,0:11:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Two planet bombs. Type MN3.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Collision course. Passing us on the starboard side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Past satellite orbit. Speed unchanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.93,0:12:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.51,0:12:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have the power to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that this ugly red planet is Mother Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait, devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight as long as I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.95,0:12:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I'm the last one alive, I will never despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.97,0:12:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,2199 AD.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The Earth is on the verge of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:13:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight years ago, Earth made first contact with alien life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Attempts at peace were met with war
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and merciless, indiscriminate attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.26,0:13:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,At the second battle of Mars,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.60,0:13:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,we were barely able to stop their direct assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But afterwards, they began long-range strikes with planet bombs,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and as a result, humanity was forced
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,to build underground cities and retreat to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The Earth Defense Fleet
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,has been almost completely destroyed by their powerful military.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Their planet bombs have dried up\Nthe land, polluted the atmosphere,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.72,0:14:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and killed everything that lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.47,0:14:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And the shadow of death
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,has started to cover the underground cities, humanity's last fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Earth is heading toward destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.07,0:14:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}Scientists say the human race may be extinct within a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.37,0:14:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy has modified the environment of Pluto,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.83,0:14:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and continues to launch their horrible weapons from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are the aliens doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.43,0:14:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like how we terraformed Mars,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.97,0:14:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,they may be trying to change the Earth so they can live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:15:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's Take Back Our Blue Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be hard, teaching kids while working at HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.98,0:15:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Another riot...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.99,0:15:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Considering the situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.45,0:15:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as unemotional as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.12,0:15:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I heard the only survivors from the First Fleet were on the Kirishima?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.62,0:15:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard something weird about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.54,0:15:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They said that Operation M was a\Ndiversion to draw the enemy away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.47,0:15:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It was classified, so they never told anybody but the brass that they were a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's just something I heard...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.15,0:15:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You work at headquarters, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Commander Okita?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.99,0:15:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:15:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.33,0:16:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, we're just back from the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.04,0:16:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Okita is in the hospital, recovering from his wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Nanbu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.50,0:16:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She looked just like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.52,0:16:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The hospital zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You really going to see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.40,0:16:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We were ordered to stay on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.19,0:16:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you're immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.41,0:16:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got the best doctor in space treating me, Dr. Sado.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.29,0:16:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, I'm not the best... Well, maybe I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the capsule?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The techs are looking at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be analyzed soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't just come in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:17:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to ask the Admiral something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true that Operation M was a diversion?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.44,0:17:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Did my brother and the others know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.35,0:17:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.19,0:17:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Hijikata!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.90,0:17:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Kodai is my student.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.49,0:17:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.74,0:17:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're Mamoru Kodai's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.37,0:17:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamoru Kodai, captain of the Yukikaze, was my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamoru Kodai was a true man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A great man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was the one who led him to his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.10,0:17:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll remain on standby as ordered, what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.44,0:17:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.52,0:17:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:17:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.16,0:18:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.57,0:18:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But you aren't the only ones to lose relatives in this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.12,0:18:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I still can't believe Captain Hijikata was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two are good friends from Officer School.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.17,0:18:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you two right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.51,0:18:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, we're not like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.14,0:18:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.47,0:18:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna have a drink with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.52,0:18:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't some cheap hooch! It's real sake, the good stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.48,0:18:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.07,0:18:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.49,0:18:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Test preparations are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It was worth believing and waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Her words were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.59,0:19:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been one year since we moved from the Izumo Plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.64,0:19:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're finally at the end of the Yamato Plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,On standby at the designated area.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a shame about Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.65,0:19:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a ship like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.90,0:19:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it's an air defense prototype?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.57,0:19:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Type-Zero Space Model 52.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.28,0:19:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,AKA the Cosmo Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.07,0:19:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a ship-based craft. It's not used for air defense missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You here to sightsee?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.41,0:19:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We were ordered to stand by here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Lt. Kato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.09,0:19:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.47,0:19:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kato...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.93,0:19:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Saburo Kato. The top ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.89,0:19:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When somebody tells you not to do something...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.23,0:19:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.73,0:19:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy mobile squad has broken through our defense line.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.03,0:19:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming down from satellite orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.19,0:20:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to intercept!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.07,0:20:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So they noticed...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.87,0:20:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We can use this to shoot them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take too long if we have to wait for orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.42,0:20:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.17,0:20:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.59,0:20:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.26,0:20:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiots! That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Got them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.19,0:20:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.44,0:20:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a recon plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.27,0:20:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.44,0:20:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.48,0:20:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to avenge my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.08,0:20:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, they took the weapons off it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.80,0:21:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.43,0:21:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,System error?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.78,0:21:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.99,0:21:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.70,0:21:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But dressed like this, we won't last until reinforcements get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.25,0:21:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.68,0:21:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.23,0:21:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.85,0:22:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what the enemy was reconning?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.77,0:22:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. It's the scrapped wreckage from a battleship, sunk ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.40,0:22:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.73,0:24:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The year is 2199.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.94,0:24:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The Earth is on the verge of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.19,0:24:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, humanity's last hope slips past the fangs of the enemy and takes flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.16,0:24:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The name of the ship is the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.41,0:24:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They leave Earth behind, and set a course for unexplored space.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.79,0:24:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "Toward a sea of stars."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.96,0:24:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 365 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:41.42,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Believe
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:45.89,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}A star will shine today
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.26,0:22:50.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Above your head
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:53.81,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Even far away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.81,0:22:58.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It pours down onto us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.82,0:23:02.69,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The same brilliance
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.69,0:23:08.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Surely it is the way to return
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.99,0:23:17.59,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}A small hope to light it up
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.26,0:23:24.59,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}To the sky you gaze upon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.59,0:23:30.89,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}If I pray to eternity for a connection
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.89,0:23:38.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Even in days of sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.98,0:23:43.15,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Can we meet once again?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.15,0:23:49.07,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}The heart knows it is all right
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.07,0:23:59.13,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)}Will it be a mutual promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.48,0:22:23.98,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1175,840)\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fade(1600,1500)}Episode 1
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.48,0:22:23.98,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1175,1073)\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fade(1600,1500)}Messenger of Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.17,0:00:35.18,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1035)\fade(500,500)\blur7.5\shad0}First Fleet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:38.76,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1035)\fade(500,500)\blur7.5\shad0}Flagship Kirishima
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:40.10,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,870)}Signal round sighted from vanguard ship Yukikaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:16.61,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1035)\fade(500,500)\blur7.5\shad0}UN Cosmo Force Far East Sector Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.92,0:04:17.06,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,870)}At 1200, the First Fleet encountered the enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.11,0:04:42.61,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1035)\fade(500,500)\blur7.5\shad0}Mars, Remains of Arcadia Port
